--- a record's field holding functions, made with one taking another kind: the refusal names what each function takes (it had said `holds a function, and this is a function`, naming neither)
struct Node [tag, painter]

fn double[x]
    return x * 2.0

fn counted[s]
    return len[s] + 0.5

log[double[1.0]]
log[counted['ab']]
a = Node['a', double]
log[a.painter[3.0]]
b = Node['b', counted]
log[b.tag]
